1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,750
This is Lumi Island.

2
00:00:01,770 --> 00:00:02,810
A tiny home at the

3
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:03,920
top of your screen,

4
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:05,270
and a little friend who

5
00:00:05,290 --> 00:00:06,120
lives in it.

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,240
Click it for your PC

7
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:09,920
at a glance.

8
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:10,550
Move away,

9
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:12,440
and it tucks itself back in.

10
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:14,280
When Lumi has nothing to say,

11
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:15,270
it just peeks.

12
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,020
Play some music,

13
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,340
and the island shows it.

14
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:21,830
Lumi even dances along.

15
00:00:21,850 --> 00:00:23,920
Scroll on the island for volume,

16
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,860
or click for the player.

17
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,660
Need to concentrate?

18
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:31,240
Start a focus session.

19
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:32,480
Lumi keeps the time,

20
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,540
suggests a break,

21
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:35,280
and celebrates your streaks.

22
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,400
Press Windows,

23
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:41,450
Alt and Space for the command bar.

24
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:42,570
Search your apps,

25
00:00:42,590 --> 00:00:44,000
start a focus session,

26
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:45,430
or just ask Lumi.

27
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:49,330
Lumi can do things for you,

28
00:00:49,350 --> 00:00:50,870
and it shows every step.

29
00:00:50,890 --> 00:00:52,410
You always see what it did,

30
00:00:52,430 --> 00:00:53,270
as it happens.

31
00:00:59,000 --> 00:00:59,970
Changed your mind?

32
00:00:59,990 --> 00:01:01,260
Press Stop, or Escape,

33
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:03,050
and Lumi stops right there.

34
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,050
Or just talk.

35
00:01:07,070 --> 00:01:08,730
The ring follows your voice,

36
00:01:08,750 --> 00:01:10,750
and Lumi's mouth moves with its own.

37
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,870
Lumi has a personality, too.

38
00:01:15,890 --> 00:01:16,770
Tap it, pet it,

39
00:01:16,790 --> 00:01:17,810
give it a squish.

40
00:01:17,830 --> 00:01:19,430
Just don't shake it too hard.

41
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,610
Choose Lumi's colour,

42
00:01:25,630 --> 00:01:26,920
how lively it is,

43
00:01:26,940 --> 00:01:28,550
and which AI it uses.

44
00:01:28,570 --> 00:01:30,480
Gemini, Claude, OpenAI,

45
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:32,480
or a model on your own PC.

46
00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:36,910
Lumi Island.

47
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:37,910
Small, helpful,

48
00:01:37,930 --> 00:01:39,260
and always just there.

